  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">Poco despu&eacute;s de las 11 de este domingo ha abierto la III Feria de Artesan&iacute;a en el barrio de la Morer&iacute;a de Onda, dentro de sus fiestas. La parte ancha de la calle San Vicente, la calle Morer&iacute;a y la plaza San Francisco de Padua albergan m&aacute;s de 20 paradas de alimentaci&oacute;n y productos artesanales, pintura o los b&uacute;hos de cetrer&iacute;a.</span></span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesaniamoreria14/img_9755.jpg\" alt=\"img_9755\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesaniamoreria14/img_9756.jpg\" alt=\"img_9756\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesaniamoreria14/img_9757.jpg\" alt=\"img_9757\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesaniamoreria14/img_9758.jpg\" alt=\"img_9758\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesaniamoreria14/img_9759.jpg\" alt=\"img_9759\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesaniamoreria14/img_9760.jpg\" alt=\"img_9760\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesaniamoreria14/img_9763.jpg\" alt=\"img_9763\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesaniamoreria14/img_9764.jpg\" alt=\"img_9764\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaarte